---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Coffee Subscription | Etude de cas">
  <section class="container case-hero">
    <div class="case-hero__intro">
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M4 6h16"></path>
            <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
            <path d="M4 18h16"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h1>Coffee Subscription</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">
            &Eacute;tude de cas &mdash; ABAP RAP (Managed + Draft) &bull; OData V4 &bull; Fiori Elements
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="badge-list">
        <span class="badge">ABAP RAP</span>
        <span class="badge">CDS</span>
        <span class="badge">BDEF</span>
        <span class="badge">Draft</span>
        <span class="badge">OData V4</span>
        <span class="badge">ADT</span>
        <span class="badge">Fiori Elements</span>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="#screens">Voir les captures</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="#architecture">Voir l&rsquo;architecture</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="/projects">Retour aux projets</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="case-hero__toc">
      <div class="card toc-card">
        <div class="card-title">Navigation rapide</div>
        <nav class="toc">
          <a href="#contexte">Contexte</a>
          <a href="#resultat">R&eacute;sultat</a>
          <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
          <a href="#chronologie">Chronologie</a>
          <a href="#tech">Points techniques</a>
          <a href="#debug">Debug &amp; difficult&eacute;s</a>
          <a href="#ressources">Ressources</a>
          <a href="#blog">Prochain blog</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container case-layout">
    <div class="case-main">
      <section id="contexte" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
              <path d="M12 8v8"></path>
              <path d="M8 12h8"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Contexte</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">
          Depuis quelques mois, je suis en mont&eacute;e en comp&eacute;tence sur RAP en parall&egrave;le
          de mes missions. Apr&egrave;s avoir consolid&eacute; la th&eacute;orie, j&rsquo;ai construit
          ce projet pour simuler un sc&eacute;nario proche de la production. L&rsquo;objectif &eacute;tait
          de livrer une application RAP de bout en bout, avec r&egrave;gles m&eacute;tier, draft,
          validations, determinations et une UI propre et coh&eacute;rente. Le tout en respectant les
          standards ADT, OData V4 et Fiori Elements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="resultat" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M12 4v16"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>R&eacute;sultat final</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-title">CRUD + Draft</div>
            <p class="muted">Gestion compl&egrave;te des abonnements avec drafts et reprise.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-title">Validations / Determinations</div>
            <p class="muted">Contr&ocirc;les m&eacute;tier &agrave; la sauvegarde et r&egrave;gles automatiques.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-title">Value Helps + UI Fiori</div>
            <p class="muted">Aides &agrave; la saisie et &eacute;crans Fiori propres et exploitables.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="card table-card">
          <div class="card-title">Fonctionnalit&eacute;s</div>
          <div class="table">
            <div class="table-row table-header">
              <span>Feature</span>
              <span>Statut</span>
              <span>Notes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>CRUD + Draft</span>
              <span class="status">Fait</span>
              <span>Gestion des abonnements</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Validations / Determinations</span>
              <span class="status">Fait</span>
              <span>R&egrave;gles m&eacute;tier centralis&eacute;es</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Value Helps</span>
              <span class="status">En cours</span>
              <span>Am&eacute;lioration des entr&eacute;es</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Extensions UI</span>
              <span class="status">&Agrave; venir</span>
              <span>Optimisation UX</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="architecture" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 4h6v6H4z"></path>
              <path d="M14 4h6v6h-6z"></path>
              <path d="M4 14h6v6H4z"></path>
              <path d="M14 14h6v6h-6z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Architecture</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card diagram-card">
          <div class="card-title">Sch&eacute;ma d&rsquo;architecture (a remplacer par image)</div>
          <!-- Remplacer la source par votre image d'architecture quand elle sera pr&ecirc;te. -->
          <img class="diagram-placeholder" src="" alt="Sch&eacute;ma d&rsquo;architecture &agrave; ajouter" />
        </div>
        <p class="muted">
          Pipeline : tables DB (persistence/draft) &rarr; CDS Interface (ZI) &rarr; CDS Projection
          (ZC + UI) &rarr; Behavior (BDEF/ZBP) &rarr; Service Definition &rarr; Service Binding OData V4
          &rarr; Fiori Elements.
        </p>
        <div class="card table-card">
          <div class="card-title">Artefacts ADT</div>
          <div class="table">
            <div class="table-row table-header">
              <span>Type</span>
              <span>Nom exemple</span>
              <span>R&ocirc;le</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Tables</span>
              <span>ZCS_SUB_TRL, ZCS_SUB_TRL_D</span>
              <span>Persistence + draft</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>CDS</span>
              <span>ZI_COFFEE_SUB_TRL, ZC_COFFEE_SUB_TRL, ZC_*_VH</span>
              <span>Mod&egrave;le et UI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Behavior</span>
              <span>ZBP_I_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</span>
              <span>R&egrave;gles et impl&eacute;mentation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Service</span>
              <span>ZUI_COFFEE_SUB_TRL, Binding O4</span>
              <span>Exposition OData V4</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="screens" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="M8 18h8"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Captures</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="screens-grid">
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
            <span class="muted">Capture &agrave; ajouter</span>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
            <span class="muted">Capture &agrave; ajouter</span>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
            <span class="muted">Capture &agrave; ajouter</span>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
            <span class="muted">Capture &agrave; ajouter</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="chronologie" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
              <path d="M12 7v6l3 3"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Chronologie</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">1. Mod&egrave;le de donn&eacute;es</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : structurer persistence et draft.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZCS_SUB_TRL</div>
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZCS_SUB_TRL_D</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
              <pre class="code-block">-- Placeholder SQL / ABAP</pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">2. CDS Interface</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : d&eacute;finir ZI et associations.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZI_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
              <pre class="code-block">@AccessControl.authorizationCheck: #NOT_REQUIRED</pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">3. CDS Projection &amp; UI</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : exposer ZC + annotations UI.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZC_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</div>
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZC_*_VH</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
              <pre class="code-block">@UI.lineItem: [&#123; position: 10 &#125;]</pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">4. Behavior Managed + Draft</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : draft et verrous.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">BDEF</div>
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZBP_I_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
              <pre class="code-block">managed; draft; lock master</pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">5. Validations / Determinations</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : contr&ocirc;les m&eacute;tier.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">Validation</div>
                <div class="timeline-chip">Determination</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
              <pre class="code-block">validate on save; determine on modify</pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">6. Value Helps</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : am&eacute;liorer la saisie.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZC_*_VH</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">7. Service Binding OData V4</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : exposer et tester.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">ZUI_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</div>
                <div class="timeline-chip">Binding O4</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
              <pre class="code-block">/IWBEP/IF_MGW_CORE_SRV_RUNTIME</pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <span class="timeline-date">8. UI finale &amp; tests</span>
                <span class="timeline-role">Objectif : valider l&rsquo;exp&eacute;rience utilisateur.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-body">
                <div class="timeline-chip">Fiori Elements</div>
                <div class="timeline-chip">Postman</div>
              </div>
              <div class="screen-row">
                <div class="screen-placeholder"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="tech" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M8 8h8"></path>
              <path d="M8 16h8"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Points techniques cl&eacute;s</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card table-card">
          <div class="table">
            <div class="table-row table-header">
              <span>Sujet</span>
              <span>Impl&eacute;mentation</span>
              <span>Pourquoi c&rsquo;est important</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Draft &amp; locking</span>
              <span>managed + draft avec verrouillage</span>
              <span>Conserver l&rsquo;int&eacute;grit&eacute; en multi-utilisateurs</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Validations vs Determinations</span>
              <span>Validate on save / determine on modify</span>
              <span>Qualit&eacute; m&eacute;tier et automatisation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>UI annotations</span>
              <span>Metadata extension + lineItem</span>
              <span>UI Fiori coh&eacute;rente</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Value Helps</span>
              <span>Vues ZC_*_VH</span>
              <span>Ergonomie &amp; fiabilit&eacute; des saisies</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>OData V4 binding</span>
              <span>Service binding + tests metadata</span>
              <span>Exposition stable pour Fiori</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Approche debug</span>
              <span>Breakpoints + traces cibl&eacute;es</span>
              <span>R&eacute;duction du temps d&rsquo;analyse</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="debug" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M9 4v16"></path>
              <path d="M15 4v16"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Debug &amp; difficult&eacute;s</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card incident-card">
            <div class="card-title">Sympt&ocirc;me</div>
            <p class="muted">L&rsquo;application ne s&rsquo;ouvre pas, erreur de m&eacute;tadonn&eacute;es.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Diagnostic</div>
            <p class="muted">Criticality mal d&eacute;finie dans la projection UI.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Correction</div>
            <p class="muted">Ajustement des annotations et revalidation du service.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Le&ccedil;on retenue</div>
            <p class="muted">Toujours tester les m&eacute;tadonn&eacute;es V4 apr&egrave;s chaque change.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card incident-card">
            <div class="card-title">Sympt&ocirc;me</div>
            <p class="muted">Draft non sauvegard&eacute; en brouillon.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Diagnostic</div>
            <p class="muted">Champ obligatoire manquant dans la persistence.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Correction</div>
            <p class="muted">Alignement structure table et CDS.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Le&ccedil;on retenue</div>
            <p class="muted">V&eacute;rifier l&rsquo;alignement DB/CDS tr&egrave;s t&ocirc;t.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card incident-card">
            <div class="card-title">Sympt&ocirc;me</div>
            <p class="muted">Erreurs 500 sur actions d&eacute;terminations.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Diagnostic</div>
            <p class="muted">Type incoh&eacute;rent dans le code handler.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Correction</div>
            <p class="muted">Correction des signatures et tests unitaires.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Le&ccedil;on retenue</div>
            <p class="muted">Logger et isoler les handlers critiques.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="ressources" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 6h16"></path>
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M4 18h10"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Ressources</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="resources-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">Docs SAP</div>
            <div class="resource-item">Lien &agrave; ajouter</div>
            <div class="resource-item">Lien &agrave; ajouter</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">SAP Community</div>
            <div class="resource-item">Lien &agrave; ajouter</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">Notes perso</div>
            <div class="resource-item">Checklist RAP</div>
            <div class="resource-item">R&egrave;gles UI</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">Outils</div>
            <div class="resource-item">Postman</div>
            <div class="resource-item">ADT</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="blog" class="section">
        <div class="card cta-card">
          <div>
            <h2>Prochain article &mdash; Mes 20% d&rsquo;ADT pour &ecirc;tre productif sur RAP</h2>
            <p class="muted">Retour sur les r&eacute;flexes qui m&rsquo;ont fait gagner du temps.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="button ghost" href="/blog/adt-rap" aria-disabled="true">Lire bient&ocirc;t</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
